OL,3,GNEWSARace to save cathedral ruins as
OL,4,Acampaign launches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA global campaign has been launched to
OL,7,Fraise money to protect the "at-risk"
OL,8,Fcathedral ruins in Coventry.
OL,10,FThe original medieval Cathedral of St
OL,11,FMichael was built between the late 14th
OL,12,Fand 15th centuries, but nearly 500
OL,13,Fyears later, it was destroyed during
OL,14,Fthe Coventry blitz in 1940.
OL,16,FCathedral leaders said the ruins were
OL,17,Fnever designed to be exposed to the
OL,18,Felements and that both the remains and
OL,19,Fthe spire were beginning to
OL,20,Fdeteriorate.
